<title>UK: Simon Engineering orders of 25 mln stg plus.</title>
<headline>Simon Engineering orders of 25 mln stg plus.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon Engineering Plc said on Thursday that its subsidiary, Simon Carves UK, had won contracts worth more than 25 million stg.</p>
<p>The contracts include one for engineering procurement and construction management of a 13 million stg photocopier toner resins plant in Scotland. Maurice Dixson, chief executive of the group, said the deals meant the company was well positioned for &quot;sustained profit growth.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
